  "description": "A Blazor component for integrating Google Maps into your applications. Easily display interactive maps, add custom markers, show routes with waypoints, and manage map interactions using a simple C# interface. Requires a Google Maps API key and the Maps JavaScript API.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
